  Hello, happy NetHackers !

  at first, please excuse my poor english.

  I'm playing NetHack3 pl9 on sun4, and, as I'm the only player here, I've
  compiled it myself. This game is great, but a little hard for me : I've
  not a lot of time to play with it, so I can`t resist cheating (I usually die
  at level 6-7).

  I've just noticed a very surprising bug : today (9/07/90) is a "lucky" day,
  but my luck decreased drastically, without apparent reasons. Finally, in
  wizard mode, I discovered that today, when I save and restore a game, my luck
  is decreased by 1 ! ( if it is already <= 0 ). That's rather curious !

  Congratulations and apologies to the dev. team...

